{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00470",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.39,
      "end_seconds": 5.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Doctor, I've brought them through. The observations are done, whenever you need them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.81,
      "end_seconds": 8.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Perfect, thanks. Hello there, so what's the trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.04,
      "end_seconds": 19.73,
      "duration_seconds": 9.69,
      "text": "Um, so... hot flushes. That's why I came. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.99,
      "end_seconds": 24.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Does it happen all the time or in spells?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.95,
      "end_seconds": 29.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "I'd say a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.45,
      "end_seconds": 31.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.49,
      "end_seconds": 39.65,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "Right, it usually comes with vaginal dryness. So, the vaginal dryness? That's been since this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.04,
      "end_seconds": 43.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "So, any irregular periods as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.8,
      "end_seconds": 48.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Um, you know, yes, about the same, two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.44,
      "end_seconds": 52.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Okay, what about night sweats, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.07,
      "end_seconds": 60.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Okay, uh, so yes, about the same, about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.2,
      "end_seconds": 65.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "On a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.82,
      "end_seconds": 68.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "It's moderate, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.38,
      "end_seconds": 72.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Have you had any bleeding after sex?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.9,
      "end_seconds": 76.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Um, not at all, no bleeding after sex."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.04,
      "end_seconds": 82.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Have you had any weight loss, heavy bleeding, chest pain or breast lumps?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.21,
      "end_seconds": 86.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Well, no, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.32,
      "end_seconds": 90.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "So, any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.27,
      "end_seconds": 96.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Right, no, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.05,
      "end_seconds": 100.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.1,
      "end_seconds": 101.97,
      "duration_seconds": 0.87,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.14,
      "end_seconds": 114.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Okay, here we go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 116.72,
      "end_seconds": 124.76,
      "duration_seconds": 8.04,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. BP is 119 over 78, respiratory rate 14, heart rate 86. Temperature 36.6, saturation 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.39,
      "end_seconds": 132.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Okay, noted. So, any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.37,
      "end_seconds": 136.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Well, not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.69,
      "end_seconds": 138.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.36,
      "end_seconds": 142.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "It's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.26,
      "end_seconds": 148.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.76,
      "end_seconds": 160.55,
      "duration_seconds": 10.79,
      "text": "Well, I have thin bones. I did try to ignore it for a while. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.02,
      "end_seconds": 162.72,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Mm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.94,
      "end_seconds": 170.58,
      "duration_seconds": 6.64,
      "text": "Um, I have an underactive thyroid, for about a year. I, I have heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.04,
      "end_seconds": 178.96,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "Yes, I can see the an underactive thyroid in your file as well. Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.41,
      "end_seconds": 185.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "I mean, you know, my sister has thyroid problems."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.25,
      "end_seconds": 187.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.54,
      "end_seconds": 193.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.08,
      "end_seconds": 196.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.57,
      "end_seconds": 203.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Right, I take alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 204.4,
      "end_seconds": 208.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 35 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.95,
      "end_seconds": 212.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "I see. Is the most recent prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.52,
      "end_seconds": 228.6,
      "duration_seconds": 15.08,
      "text": "Okay, so I don't think I have it with me. Yeah, it's Thyronorm, 50 micrograms, every morning for my thyroid. I'm on aspirin, 75 milligrams, maybe, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.12,
      "end_seconds": 233.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Okay, is the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.49,
      "end_seconds": 238.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Well, um, no, it's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.58,
      "end_seconds": 241.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.61,
      "end_seconds": 248.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Oh, just a bypass operation, six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.14,
      "end_seconds": 255.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.58,
      "end_seconds": 257.28,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.99,
      "end_seconds": 260.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.36,
      "end_seconds": 279.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Blood pressure and pulse are fine, and there are no breast lumps on examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.59,
      "end_seconds": 295.17,
      "duration_seconds": 9.58,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.79,
      "end_seconds": 303.1,
      "duration_seconds": 7.31,
      "text": "Yeah, uh, busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.53,
      "end_seconds": 311.59,
      "duration_seconds": 8.06,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. This looks most like perimenopausal symptoms. It could also be a thyroid problem, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.06,
      "end_seconds": 315.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.66,
      "end_seconds": 331.84,
      "duration_seconds": 15.18,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's perimenopausal symptoms, and we'll know more once the blood tests is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had hot flushes, and no weight loss or breast lumps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.16,
      "end_seconds": 334.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Uh, yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.46,
      "end_seconds": 359.11,
      "duration_seconds": 22.65,
      "text": "We should do blood tests for irregular periods. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Let's get a bone density scan, for menopause. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. Layers of clothing, a fan by the bed, and cutting down on caffeine and spicy food can help the flushes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.9,
      "end_seconds": 380.65,
      "duration_seconds": 20.75,
      "text": "Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.21,
      "end_seconds": 382.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.92,
      "end_seconds": 388.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 389.82,
      "end_seconds": 390.52,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 392.06,
      "end_seconds": 400.75,
      "duration_seconds": 8.69,
      "text": "Come back after the results are back. I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 401.92,
      "end_seconds": 407.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 408.58,
      "end_seconds": 414.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, that's all I have. Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 415.04,
      "end_seconds": 418.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "That's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 419.83,
      "end_seconds": 420.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}